      "text": "pump ursprungligen valdes, men den nya användningen måste",
      "bbox": {
        "x0": 27.0,
        "top": 271.92,
        "x1": 183.14,
        "bottom": 278.92
      },
      "reading_order": 47,
      "block_type": "text_line"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "MP016:p0039:b0048",
      "text": "anvisningar vid installation och drift av pumpen.",
      "bbox": {
        "x0": 229.68,
        "top": 275.642,
        "x1": 357.953,
        "bottom": 282.642
      },
      "reading_order": 48,
      "block_type": "text_line"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "MP016:p0039:b0049",
      "text": "kontrolleras mot databladet för att säkerställa säker och tillförlitlig",
      "bbox": {
        "x0": 27.0,
        "top": 280.32,
        "x1": 186.64,
        "bottom": 287.32
      },
      "reading_order": 49,
      "block_type": "text_line"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "MP016:p0039:b0050",
      "text": "drift. Vi rekommenderar starkt att du, om ändrad uppgift krävs,",
      "bbox": {
        "x0": 27.0,
        "top": 288.72,
        "x1": 179.24,
        "bottom": 295.72
      },
      "reading_order": 50,
      "block_type": "text_line"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "MP016:p0039:b0051",
      "text": "2.01 Driftbegränsningar",
      "bbox": {
        "x0": 207.0,
        "top": 296.545,
        "x1": 289.326,
        "bottom": 303.545
      },
      "reading_order": 51,
      "block_type": "text_line"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "MP016:p0039:b0052",
      "text": "kontaktar distributören som levererade enheten eller tillverkaren.",
      "bbox": {
        "x0": 27.0,
        "top": 297.12,
        "x1": 186.435,
        "bottom": 304.12
      },
      "reading_order": 52,
      "block_type": "text_line"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "MP016:p0039:b0053",
      "text": "Ändrad uppgift innebär att någon av parametrarna som anges",
      "bbox": {
        "x0": 27.0,
        "top": 305.52,
        "x1": 178.008,
        "bottom": 312.52
      },
      "reading_order": 53,
      "block_type": "text_line"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "MP016:p0039:b0054",
      "text": "SÖMNING: Pumpar med flexibla impellrar är självsugande",
      "bbox": {
        "x0": 207.0,
        "top": 307.797,
        "x1": 359.458,
        "bottom": 314.825
      },
      "reading_order": 54,
      "block_type": "text_line"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "MP016:p0039:b0055",
      "text": "ovan ändras.",
      "bbox": {
        "x0": 27.0,
        "top": 313.92,
        "x1": 58.1,
        "bottom": 320.92
      },
      "reading_order": 55,
      "block_type": "text_line"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "MP016:p0039:b0056",
      "text": "och ska installeras i enlighet med databladets rekommendationer",
      "bbox": {
        "x0": 207.0,
        "top": 316.225,
        "x1": 367.115,
        "bottom": 323.225
      },
      "reading_order": 56,
      "block_type": "text_line"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "MP016:p0039:b0057",
      "text": "för sughöjd.",
      "bbox": {
        "x0": 207.0,
        "top": 324.625,
        "x1": 236.561,
        "bottom": 331.625
      },
      "reading_order": 57,
      "block_type": "text_line"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "MP016:p0039:b0058",
      "text": "1.04 Modellnumreringssystem",
      "bbox": {
        "x0": 27.0,
        "top": 328.83,
        "x1": 131.257,
        "bottom": 335.83
      },
      "reading_order": 58,
      "block_type": "text_line"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "MP016:p0039:b0059",
      "text": "TRYCK: Kör inte pumpen över det maximala differenstryck som",
      "bbox": {
        "x0": 207.0,
        "top": 335.877,
        "x1": 366.549,
        "bottom": 342.905
      },
      "reading_order": 59,
      "block_type": "text_line"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "MP016:p0039:b0060",
      "text": "Pumpens ändkåpa är graverad och anger modell- och serienummer.",
      "bbox": {
        "x0": 27.0,
        "top": 340.11,
        "x1": 188.804,
        "bottom": 347.11
      },
      "reading_order": 60,
      "block_type": "text_line"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "MP016:p0039:b0061",
      "text": "anges på databladet, inte ens under några sekunder, eftersom",
      "bbox": {
        "x0": 207.0,
        "top": 344.305,
        "x1": 358.302,
        "bottom": 351.305
      },
      "reading_order": 61,
      "block_type": "text_line"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "MP016:p0039:b0062",
      "text": "pumphjulet då kan skadas.",
      "bbox": {
        "x0": 207.0,
        "top": 352.705,
        "x1": 272.967,
        "bottom": 359.705
      },
      "reading_order": 62,
      "block_type": "text_line"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "MP016:p0039:b0063",
      "text": "OBSERVERA",
      "bbox": {
        "x0": 229.68,
        "top": 376.962,
        "x1": 272.002,
        "bottom": 383.962
      },
      "reading_order": 63,
      "block_type": "text_line"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "MP016:p0039:b0064",
      "text": "Kör aldrig pumpen mot en stängd ventil.",
      "bbox": {
        "x0": 229.68,
        "top": 385.362,
        "x1": 337.004,
        "bottom": 392.362
      },
      "reading_order": 64,
      "block_type": "text_line"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "MP016:p0039:b0065",
      "text": "FASTA ÄMNEN: Pumpar med flexibelt impellerhjul kan",
      "bbox": {
        "x0": 207.0,
        "top": 408.332,
        "x1": 353.949,
        "bottom": 415.36
      },
      "reading_order": 65,
      "block_type": "text_line"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "MP016:p0039:b0066",
      "text": "hantera medföljande fasta partiklar.",
      "bbox": {
        "x0": 207.0,
        "top": 416.76,
        "x1": 294.246,
        "bottom": 423.76
      },
      "reading_order": 66,
      "block_type": "text_line"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "MP016:p0039:b0067",
      "text": "KAVITATION: Pumparna kan inte arbeta om det inte finns till-",
      "bbox": {
        "x0": 207.0,
        "top": 428.012,
        "x1": 367.318,
        "bottom": 435.04
      },
      "reading_order": 67,
      "block_type": "text_line"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "MP016:p0039:b0068",
      "text": "räckligt med vätsketryck vid inloppsporten för att försörja pumpen.",
      "bbox": {
        "x0": 207.0,
        "top": 436.44,
        "x1": 369.153,
        "bottom": 443.44
      },
      "reading_order": 68,
      "block_type": "text_line"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "MP016:p0039:b0069",
      "text": "Normalt räcker det med atmosfärstryck, men det faktiska tryck som",
      "bbox": {
        "x0": 207.0,
        "top": 444.84,
        "x1": 368.747,
        "bottom": 451.84
      },
      "reading_order": 69,
      "block_type": "text_line"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "MP016:p0039:b0070",
      "text": "krävs (NIPR, Net Inlet Pressure Required) är högre för:",
      "bbox": {
        "x0": 207.0,
        "top": 453.24,
        "x1": 337.429,
        "bottom": 460.24
      },
      "reading_order": 70,
      "block_type": "text_line"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "MP016:p0039:b0071",
      "text": "• Hög temperatur",
      "bbox": {
        "x0": 207.0,
        "top": 463.8,
        "x1": 255.234,
        "bottom": 470.8
      },
      "reading_order": 71,
      "block_type": "text_line"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "MP016:p0039:b0072",
      "text": "• Höga pumphastigheter",
      "bbox": {
        "x0": 207.0,
        "top": 473.64,
        "x1": 273.169,
        "bottom": 480.64
      },
      "reading_order": 72,
      "block_type": "text_line"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "MP016:p0039:b0073",
      "text": "Figur 2 — Exempel på ändkåpa",
      "bbox": {
        "x0": 70.985,
        "top": 476.165,
        "x1": 145.015,
        "bottom": 483.165
      },
      "reading_order": 73,
      "block_type": "text_line"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "MP016:p0039:b0074",
      "text": "MODELLNUMRET anger viktig information om pumpens specifikation, se 7",
      "bbox": {
        "x0": 30.239,
        "top": 485.611,
        "x1": 185.762,
        "bottom": 491.611
      },
      "reading_order": 74,
      "block_type": "text_line"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "MP016:p0039:b0075",
      "text": "Otillräckligt inloppstryck kommer att få pumpen att kavitera, vilket",
      "bbox": {
        "x0": 207.0,
        "top": 486.54,
        "x1": 367.759,
        "bottom": 493.54
      },
      "reading_order": 75,
      "block_type": "text_line"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "MP016:p0039:b0076",
      "text": "PUMPNUMMERMATRIS för mer detaljer.",
      "bbox": {
        "x0": 65.938,
        "top": 491.611,
        "x1": 150.243,
        "bottom": 497.611
      },
      "reading_order": 76,
      "block_type": "text_line"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "MP016:p0039:b0077",
      "text": "leder till låg prestanda, buller och kort livslängd för pumpen. Se",
      "bbox": {
        "x0": 207.0,
        "top": 494.94,
        "x1": 362.299,
        "bottom": 501.94
      },
      "reading_order": 77,
      "block_type": "text_line"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "MP016:p0039:b0078",
      "text": "till att inloppsrören är korta, har stora hål och inte kollapsar under",
      "bbox": {
        "x0": 207.0,
        "top": 503.34,
        "x1": 366.261,
        "bottom": 510.34
      },
      "reading_order": 78,
      "block_type": "text_line"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "MP016:p0039:b0079",
      "text": "1.05 Inspektion vid mottagande",
      "bbox": {
        "x0": 27.0,
        "top": 506.469,
        "x1": 136.304,
        "bottom": 513.469
      },
      "reading_order": 79,
      "block_type": "text_line"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "MP016:p0039:b0080",
      "text": "vakuum.",
      "bbox": {
        "x0": 207.0,
        "top": 511.74,
        "x1": 228.301,
        "bottom": 518.74
      },
      "reading_order": 80,
      "block_type": "text_line"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "MP016:p0039:b0081",
      "text": "Flexibla impellerpumpar inspekteras av fabriken före packning",
      "bbox": {
        "x0": 27.0,
        "top": 517.749,
        "x1": 179.932,
        "bottom": 524.749
      },
      "reading_order": 81,
      "block_type": "text_line"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "MP016:p0039:b0082",
      "text": "Om du är osäker, kontakta din leverantör innan du kör pumpen.",
      "bbox": {
        "x0": 207.0,
        "top": 523.02,
        "x1": 362.292,
        "bottom": 530.02
      },
      "reading_order": 82,
      "block_type": "text_line"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "MP016:p0039:b0083",
      "text": "och frakt, för att säkerställa säker leverans och tillfredsställande",
      "bbox": {
        "x0": 27.0,
        "top": 526.149,
        "x1": 179.66,
        "bottom": 533.149
      },
      "reading_order": 83,
      "block_type": "text_line"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "MP016:p0039:b0084",
      "text": "service.",
      "bbox": {
        "x0": 27.0,
        "top": 534.549,
        "x1": 45.256,
        "bottom": 541.549
      },
      "reading_order": 84,
      "block_type": "text_line"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "MP016:p0039:b0085",
      "text": "Vi rekommenderar att du utför följande åtgärder vid mottagandet",
      "bbox": {
        "x0": 27.0,
        "top": 545.829,
        "x1": 186.24,
        "bottom": 552.829
      },
      "reading_order": 85,
      "block_type": "text_line"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "MP016:p0039:b0086",
      "text": "av din pump:",
      "bbox": {
        "x0": 27.0,
        "top": 554.229,
        "x1": 59.76,
        "bottom": 561.229
      },
      "reading_order": 86,
      "block_type": "text_line"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "MP016:p0039:b0087",
      "text": "a. Avlägsna förpackningsmaterialet från behållaren och jämför",
      "bbox": {
        "x0": 27.0,
        "top": 567.129,
        "x1": 181.933,
        "bottom": 574.129
      },
      "reading_order": 87,
      "block_type": "text_line"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "MP016:p0039:b0088",
      "text": "innehållet med packlistan.",
      "bbox": {
        "x0": 36.0,
        "top": 575.529,
        "x1": 100.862,
        "bottom": 582.529
      },
      "reading_order": 88,
      "block_type": "text_line"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "MP016:p0039:b0089",
      "text": "39",
      "bbox": {
        "x0": 194.34,
        "top": 587.476,
        "x1": 201.66,
        "bottom": 593.476
      },
      "reading_order": 89,
